Package: jewbuntu-mint
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jewbuntu Developers <maintainers@jewbuntu.invalid>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: cinnamon | cinnamon-core, libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: shulgo-xfce
Homepage: https://jewbuntu.com
Description: Jewbuntu skin for Linux Mint (Cinnamon)
 A light Jewbuntu skin over Linux Mint's Cinnamon desktop. Mint itself is not
 changed and keeps getting Mint's and Ubuntu's updates. Only Cinnamon's
 defaults change, so every setting you chose yourself is kept:
  - a Star of David as the menu button on the panel
  - the blue Star of David wallpaper on the desktop and the login screen
  - Jewbuntu's short jingle as the sign-in sound
  - ShulGo's minyan widget in the panel (recommended package shulgo-xfce)
